    "title": "OU report details hazing violations from closed Sigma Phi Epsilon fraternity - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amanda Siew ,\n1 days ago NORMAN, Okla. - The University of Oklahoma has released a report detailing hazing violations committed bySigma Phi Epsilon, a now-closed fraternity on campus. The fraternity’s national headquarters voted in February to revoke the OU chapter’s charter following an internal membership review. A reason was not given then. University officials also said it was not consulted in the closure decision. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
